<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct housing starts up 21.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct housing starts up 21.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts in October were up 21.4 percent from a year earlier to 159,987 units, the Construction Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>					Oct starts   yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes			57,507	   +14.2</p>
<p> Rental homes			 67,751	   +31.1</p>
<p> Employee housing		    2,683	    +6.7</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	   32,046	   +17.5</p>
<p>  (Condominiums)		    17,878	   +11.8</p>
<p> Total				 159,987	   +21.4</p>
</text>
